    {"bug": "plist/2", "property": "rust/plist::deeply_nested_xml_parses_without_stack_overflow", "basis": "inferred", "note": "The bug is a recursive-Drop overflow on a deeply nested parsed Value; this property parses arrays/dicts nested to 20,000 and drops the result through a `dismantle` helper, i.e. it works around precisely this failure."},
